# ===========================
# Roo Code Indexing Ignore
# Unity Project: Pen
# ===========================

# --- Unity 生成目录 (必须排除) ---
Library/
Temp/
Obj/
Build/
Builds/
Logs/
UserSettings/
MemoryCaptures/
Recordings/

# --- 包管理锁文件（通常不需要让 Agent 读取） ---
Packages/packages-lock.json

# --- 二进制资源文件 ---
*.fbx
*.FBX
*.obj
*.OBJ
*.3ds
*.3DS
*.lxo
*.LXO
*.ma
*.MA
*.blend
*.blend1
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.tga
*.tif
*.tiff
*.psd
*.ico
*.bmp
*.svg
*.webp
*.exr
*.hdr
*.cubemap
*.wav
*.mp3
*.ogg
*.aif
*.aiff
*.mid
*.midi
*.dll
*.exe
*.so
*.dylib
*.a
*.pdb
*.mdb

# --- Unity Meta文件 ---
*.meta

# --- Unity 场景和预制件 (YAML二进制混合,索引价值低) ---
*.unity
*.prefab
*.asset
*.mat
*.physicMaterial
*.flare
*.controller
*.overrideController
*.anim
*.mask
*.lighting
*.giparams
*.renderTexture

# --- 第三方插件 (减少噪音) ---
Assets/Plugins/Feel
Assets/TextMesh Pro/
Assets/TutorialInfo/

# --- IDE / 编辑器生成文件 ---
.vs/
.idea/
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.opendb
*.VC.db

# --- 系统文件 ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log

# --- 其他 ---
ServerData/
*.unitypackage
crashlytics-build.properties
